.git/
.venv/
dev/
services/data-store/.data/
services/data-store/logs/
# Every service's, not just data-store's: Dockerfile.api COPYs the whole services/ tree, so
# a secret file added under any workspace member would otherwise be baked into the image.
# `.env.example` is deliberately not matched -- it holds no secrets and documents the contract.
**/.env
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.testmondata
.claude/
